KLKJF&_nc_oc=AdnijCQOtQbsc78adxY5dkAwTfjNZOgdhEPQHPAhoja-72-89Xjf8pUcd0neX30ifog&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afuwkk09GU3pEmw9mcFu3Djjr9b3FuCpCiwMOa-P8pzqiA&oe=69A0270D"}, {"file_name": "ss2.png", "id": "1579721169894060", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619805_1579721173227393_7848210170827800035_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Sn7U4tg97vAQ7kNvwF4HjpE&_nc_oc=AdkzXq3CZWjLRr5GUyn1hP_EqdrBPaE17ODiEliBVLLoS0GWmprb_nr687AyGBpjJpw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuN2bHLUhrUHSYM5EvrNgJi_3c7-h2wmfh3ZfCAocVR4Q&oe=69A047C4"}, {"file_name": "ss3.png", "id": "865789709958631", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499617847_865789713291964_4057427824419699951_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qhzTAja-CBEQ7kNvwGJYQEb&_nc_oc=Adk7UpjcmGPjIL80LhrJm1Jonue19PmbW9RL6g7K2Nwvfi6xspSs0ymUT5KGSzd89bs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvYl5K8zoQDPqVrVary0Pm9pq_1MjuczgYiY42hTyRbyw&oe=69A02DB8"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Artboard 1.png", "id": "1829955161047924", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618102_1829955164381257_2062099350217466376_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TQ8sa9jMhyYQ7kNvwFfkKu7&_nc_oc=AdmUA2odtoSpMFkRbQmnS3VbCEB5rRK65I2phLv297hVYMfGllo2KnlHkIORk4lRv14&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfscXjimmFzeS1NbYxvYpQU815mwQ-Qj1NTLOO_GEmMNBA&oe=69A038DF"}, "display_name": "Paintball Arena VR", "keywords": ["Paintball", "multiplayer", "action", "shooter", "Platformer"], "long_description": "Paintball Arena is a tactical, multiplayer team based VR shooter that captures the energy and excitement of real paintball inside immersive, lifelike virtual arenas. Designed for both casual fun and competitive play, it combines responsive motion-based shooting, realistic combat physics, and flexible game modes for every type of player.\n\nBefore diving into battle, step into the **Global Lobby**  \u2014 a vibrant social hub where players from around the world can meet, chat, and interact in real time. Explore the space, challenge other players to matches, watch live battles in spectator mode, or simply hang out with friends before heading into the arena. It\u2019s the perfect place to connect, compete, and prepare for the action ahead!\n{3669608836514808}\n\n# Choose from multiple ways to play:\n\n**AI Matches** \u2013 Play anytime, anywhere with smart AI teammates and enemies that adapt to your tactics. Perfect for solo training or skill improvement.\n{1109996237752723}\n\n**Quick Match** \u2013 Fast-paced multiplayer 3 round matches with respawns for continuous action. Great for short sessions and casual fun.\n{724646193895010}\n\n**Ranked Match** \u2013 5-round, no-respawn mode where every move counts. Team coordination and strategy decide the outcome.\n{31045581248422511}\n\n**Custom Lobbies** \u2013 Invite friends and set your own rules for private tournaments or team practice sessions.\n{1308944160937709}\n\nWith its highly detailed arenas, intuitive VR controls, and multiple play styles, Paintball VR Arena ensures every match feels unique and exhilarating.", "short_description": "Paintball VR Arena brings the thrill of real paintball into VR with tactical, team-based matches and full motion-based shooting. Train in a dedicated practice ground, battle offline with smart AI, or jump online for Quick Matches, Ranked play, or custom games with friends. With lifelike arenas, responsive combat physics, and multiple modes, every match feels intense and immersive.\n\nStep in, aim true, and experience the ultimate VR paintball showdown."}]}, "developer_name": "5thScape", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://5thscape.com/paintball-arena-privacypolicy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "5thScape", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://5thscape.com/", "category": null, "co